<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian soybean and product market.</title>
<headline>Brazilian soybean and product market.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers reported the following Brazilian soybean, products basis levels.</p>
<p>(NS - no seller T-Trade P-Premium D-Discount, NB - no bidder)</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS	  MONTH	   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soybean (cents per bushel)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> June		18/10 D	June	    20/10 D</p>
<p> July		15/10 D	July	    18/10 D</p>
<p> August	    20/40 P	August	  25/40 P</p>
<p> Sept	     85/120 P	Sept	   90/130 P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS	  MONTH	   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soymeal/Pellets (dollars per short tonne 48 pct profat)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> June		28/24 D	June	    27/25 D</p>
<p> July		26/24 D	July	    26/25 D</p>
<p> August	     10/6 D	August	    9/7 D</p>
<p> Sept		  4/7 P	Sept		4/6 P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	 BASIS	   MONTH	  PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soybean Oil (dollars per tonne, points per lb, crude, degummed)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> June		30/60 P	 June	   35/55 P</p>
<p> July		30/60 P	 July	   35/55 P</p>
<p> August	    15/50 P	 August	 10/50 P</p>
<p> Sept		10/50 P	 Sept	   10/50 P</p>
